{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implemented: route_for now resolves aliases to their owning Route with canonical-name precedence (retired routes' aliases do not resolve). Added _index(routes) helper + module-level _BY_ALIAS and an optional routes=ROUTES param mirroring derive_policy_sets. RED->GREEN unit tests added in tests/unit/test_cli_registry.py. make lint + typecheck + registry/dispatch/cutover tests all green (module 791 LOC, under cap). Pushed as Gerrit change 2179 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2179), awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787558489285247001,"uuid":"81165e48-1ff7-478a-9aea-d2c0acebeaf9"}